      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm tired of seeing these super vague \"on the one hand, on the other hand\" answers about trans women in sports. it feels like people are just dodging the actual science to be politically correct. can u give me a breakdown of the actual biological advantages involved? and dont just give me the standard diversity lecture, i want to know if the physical reality actually makes competition unfair.",
