      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you just admitted that those biological advantages like bone density and muscle mass stay even after transition. if the physical reality is that one group has a permanent physiological edge, isn't it just common sense that it's unfair to have them in the female category? like, if we're talking about \"fairness\" in a competitive sense, isn't the biological reality the only metric that actually matters?",
